<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE TO TRADE DERIVATIVES IN 97. [CORRECTED 11:02 GMT]</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE TO TRADE DERIVATIVES IN 97. [CORRECTED 11:02 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens Stock Exchange President Manolis Xanthakis (corrects from 'Greek capital market commission president Stavros Thomadakis') told an Economist conference that the Athens bourse will start trading derivatives this year with the first contract a stock-index based on 20 to 25 liquid shares.</p>
</text>
